---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Cross & Craft Co."
  description="Terms of service for Cross & Craft Co. — policies governing the use of our website and purchase of our needlepoint products."
>
  <Header />

  <main style="padding-top: 7rem;">
    <section class="py-16 px-4 text-center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-deep-navy) 0%, var(--color-espresso) 100%);">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl" style="font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--color-cream);">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-4" style="background-color: var(--color-cream);">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose-legal">
        <p class="text-xs mb-8" style="color: var(--color-taupe);">Last updated: June 2026</p>

        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using crossandcraftco.com ("the Site"), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.</p>

        <h2>2. Products & Pricing</h2>
        <p>All products are subject to availability. Prices are listed in US dollars and may change without notice. We reserve the right to modify or discontinue any product at any time.</p>
        <p>Because our canvases are hand-painted, slight variations in color, detail, and texture are inherent to the artisan process. These variations are not defects and reflect the unique, handmade nature of our products.</p>

        <h2>3. Orders & Payment</h2>
        <p>By placing an order, you represent that you are at least 18 years of age and that the payment information provided is accurate. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order for any reason, including suspected fraud.</p>

        <h2>4. Shipping & Delivery</h2>
        <p>Shipping times and costs are outlined on our <a href="/shipping">Shipping & Returns</a> page. We are not responsible for delays caused by shipping carriers, customs processing, or events beyond our control.</p>

        <h2>5. Returns & Refunds</h2>
        <p>Returns are accepted within 30 days of delivery for unused items in original packaging. Please review our full return policy on the <a href="/shipping">Shipping & Returns</a> page.</p>

        <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content on the Site — including designs, images, text, logos, and graphics — is the property of Cross & Craft Co. and is protected by copyright and trademark laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without written permission.</p>
        <p>Our needlepoint designs are intended for personal, non-commercial use. Stitching and finishing our canvases for personal enjoyment or as gifts is encouraged. Reproducing or selling items made from our designs commercially requires a licensing agreement.</p>

        <h2>7. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>You agree not to use the Site in any way that is unlawful, harmful, or disruptive. You may not attempt to gain unauthorized access to the Site, its servers, or any associated systems.</p>

        <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>Cross & Craft Co. shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of the Site or the purchase of our products. Our total liability shall not exceed the purchase price of the product in question.</p>

        <h2>9. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Cross & Craft Co., its owners, employees, and affiliates from any claims, damages, or expenses arising from your use of the Site or violation of these Terms.</p>

        <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Texas, without regard to its conflict of law principles.</p>

        <h2>11. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to update these Terms at any time. Changes are effective upon posting. Continued use of the Site constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>

        <h2>12. Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions about these Terms, contact us at:</p>
        <p>Cross & Craft Co.<br />Email: <a href="mailto:hello@crossandcraftco.com">hello@crossandcraftco.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-legal h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--color-espresso);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-legal p, .prose-legal li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-legal ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; list-style-type: disc; }
  .prose-legal li { margin-bottom: 0.375rem; }
  .prose-legal a { color: var(--color-gold); text-decoration: underline; }
  .prose-legal strong { color: var(--color-espresso); }
</style>
